  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pvfb](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pvfb) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Apr 27 2025 30km NW of Mabaag Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 19.1387 longitude 121.1873. It impacted 10824 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
